              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಈ ಹಳೆಯ ಮನೆ ಅಜ್ಜಿಯ ಬಳುವಳಿ. ī haḷeya mane ajjiya baḷuvaḷi. This old house is Grandmother's legacy."
            },
