          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೀಡಿಸು — pīḍisu — \"to pester; to torment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮನೆಗಾಗಿ ಸಂಬಂಧಿಕರು ಅಜ್ಜಿಯನ್ನು ತುಂಬಾ ಪೀಡಿಸಿದರು. manegāgi sambandhikaru ajjiyannu tumbā pīḍisidaru. The relatives pestered Grandmother a lot for the house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಪೀಡಿಸಿದೆ, pīḍiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person troubled takes -ಅನ್ನು. Illness too ಪೀಡಿಸು (pīḍisu): ರೋಗ ಪೀಡಿಸಿತು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೀಡಿಸು (pīḍisu) is built on Sanskrit pīḍā, \"pain, damage\" (CDIAL 8227), from the root pīḍ, \"to press, to hurt\", with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
        },
